T SelectionSequence                    | SelectionSequence.h | 44-97 | owning                        | -  | The session's selections, traversable backwards and forwards on their own. reopening with someone else's selection has restored a decision the artist had already finished making, and the first stroke lands on the wrong occupant. Recorded as `00` §10 conflict 34. minute: move three occupants, undo, and the transforms revert while the selection does not. It is not in the document's sequence, and it is not unrevisioned either.
